# Generated by the capture pipeline. Everything here is reproducible from the
# committed raw frames plus lines.md, and some of it is large.
#
# What IS committed, deliberately: episodes/*/frames/raw and frames/clean.
# Those are the only irreplaceable part -- re-capturing them means driving a real
# mailbox again, while a wording change is just a re-render. Three wording
# changes landed as free re-renders because 004's frames were in the repo, and
# 003 could not take them because its frames were swept.

episodes/*/frames/voice/          # edge-tts output, regenerated per render
episodes/*/frames/review/         # stills pulled to proofread a cut
episodes/*/frames/concat.txt      # absolute paths; machine-specific
episodes/*/frames/picture_len
episodes/*/frames/raw-*.mp4       # pre-overlay intermediate
episodes/*/frames/render.log
episodes/*/frames/_*.png          # scratch grabs taken while aiming a shot
